flowchart LR
  accTitle: Hybrid live ISO and installed operating systems partition layout
  accDescr: An EFI system partition is followed by a sized exFAT ISO volume and a Btrfs pool that receives the remaining drive capacity.

  ESP[ESP - FAT32]
  ISO[exFAT - ISO space]
  BTRFS[Btrfs pool - remaining space]
  ESP --- ISO --- BTRFS

  classDef esp fill:#3d5a80,stroke:#27415f,color:#eef2f7,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef exfat fill:#0b6e4f,stroke:#07543d,color:#eef7f2,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef btrfs fill:#9a3412,stroke:#76270d,color:#fff7ed,stroke-width:2px;
  class ESP esp;
  class ISO exfat;
  class BTRFS btrfs;
  linkStyle 0,1 stroke:transparent;
